# Generated native folders (CNG). This file replaces every .gitignore for EAS
# uploads, so a local `expo prebuild` / `expo run:ios` output must be excluded
# here too — otherwise EAS skips prebuild and archives the stale local project.
mobile/ios
mobile/android
# Service-account private keys never go into a build archive (EAS credentials hold them).
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
